## 🏗️ Tech Stack

### Frontend

| Technology | Purpose |
|------------|----------|
| [Next.js (App Router)](https://nextjs.org) | Modern React Framework |
| [React](https://react.dev) | Component-based UI |
| [Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com) | Responsive Styling |
| [TypeScript](https://typescriptlang.org) / JavaScript | Frontend Development |
| [Lucide React](https://lucide.dev) | Icon Library |
| [Recharts](https://recharts.org) | Interactive Charts |

### Backend

| Technology | Purpose |
|------------|----------|
| [FastAPI](https://tiangolo.com) | REST API |
| [Uvicorn](https://uvicorn.org) | ASGI Server |
| [Psycopg2](https://psycopg.org) | PostgreSQL Driver |
| [Pydantic](https://pydantic.dev) | Data Validation |
| [Python](https://python.org) | Backend Language |

### Database & Infrastructure

| Technology | Purpose |
|------------|----------|
| [PostgreSQL](https://postgresql.org) | Relational Database |
| [Neon Database](https://neon.tech) | Cloud PostgreSQL |
| [Git](https://git-scm.com) | Version Control |
| [GitHub](https://github.com/) | Source Code Hosting |

